  "question": {
    "text": "The gas evolved on heating <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CaF</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>SiO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;with concentrated <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></math>, on hydrolysis gives a white gelatinous precipitate. The precipitate is:"
