  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Reactions involved are<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>CaF</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mfenced><mrow><mi>Conc</mi><mo>.</mo></mrow></mfenced></mtd><mtd><mover><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi></mover></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>CaSO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>HF</mo><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>SiO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>HF</mo><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced></mtd><mtd><mover><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi></mover></mtd><mtd><msub><mi>SiF</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>SiF</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>&#8594;</mo></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>SiF</mi><mn>6</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>SiO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></p><p>The mixture after hydrolysis apperas as white gelatinous precipitate.</p>"
